# Task 3 - SQL for Data Analysis

## Objective
Use SQL queries to extract and analyse data from an Ecommerce database.

## Tools Used
- MySQL
- MySQL Workbench

## Topics Covered
- SELECT
- WHERE
- ORDER BY
- GROUP BY
- SUM()
- AVG()
- INNER JOIN
- LEFT JOIN
- RIGHT JOIN
- Subqueries
- NULL Handling
- Views
- Indexes
- Query Optimisation

## Database
Ecommerce Database

## Tables
- customers
- products
- orders

## Project Work
This project includes SQL queries for data extraction, filtering, sorting, grouping, aggregation, joining multiple tables, subqueries, NULL handling, views and query optimisation.

## Deliverables
- SQL query file
- SQL output screenshots
- Database analysis

